WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 9]

01:34.320 --> 01:36.480
Didn't he say he wanted to practice
a clean and honest governance?

01:36.480 --> 01:38.080
He said he wouldn't accept any bribes.

01:38.100 --> 01:39.700
In the end, he still took it.

01:39.900 --> 01:41.700
How could you say that in public?

01:42.180 --> 01:43.260
Shut up!

01:45.620 --> 01:47.600
They're clearing the streets!
They're clearing the streets!

01:47.620 --> 01:49.580
They're clearing the streets!
They're clearing the streets!

01:49.600 --> 01:51.220
Run! They're clearing the streets!

01:53.620 --> 01:54.860
Hurry!

02:13.460 --> 02:14.580
Your Highness.

02:15.460 --> 02:17.320
Fan Xian took a bribe in public.

02:17.340 --> 02:18.420
Indeed.

02:19.180 --> 02:20.380
Doesn't that mean he's giving you

02:20.380 --> 02:21.480
the goods on him?

02:21.500 --> 02:23.600
Your Highness,
if you use this chance to impeach him,

02:23.620 --> 02:25.160
maybe you can kick him out of his post.

02:25.180 --> 02:26.620
Treat it as if nothing had happened.

02:26.620 --> 02:28.160
Aren't you going to do anything?

02:36.340 --> 02:40.180
Why did you think he called me to be there when he
took the bribe from the Crop Inspection Bureau?

02:42.660 --> 02:44.040
Your Highness, are you saying

02:44.060 --> 02:45.740
that he did it on purpose?

02:46.380 --> 02:49.380
Could it be that he's surrendering
and that he wishes to serve you?

02:59.180 --> 03:01.580
That'd usually be the case
if it were anyone else.

03:01.740 --> 03:03.140
But Fan Xian?

03:03.780 --> 03:05.160
I can't figure out

03:05.180 --> 03:07.140
what exactly he's up to.

03:08.300 --> 03:09.700
His unpredictability

03:10.020 --> 03:11.580
makes things fun.

03:31.020 --> 03:31.460
Your Majesty,

03:31.480 --> 03:33.600
several censors from
the Imperial Procuratorate

03:33.620 --> 03:36.180
have submitted a joint impeachment
against Mr. Fan Xian.

03:39.275 --> 03:41.060
[Inspector Fan Xian abused his power
and took bribes]

03:41.060 --> 03:42.000
For what charges?

03:42.020 --> 03:44.640
They're impeaching Mr. Fan Xian
for abusing his power,

03:44.660 --> 03:46.040
taking bribes,

03:46.060 --> 03:47.860
and disregarding the law.

03:48.460 --> 03:50.580
Hand this to the Ministry of Works.

03:53.380 --> 03:54.460
Wait.

03:56.220 --> 03:58.040
Hand this memorandum to Fan Xian.

03:58.060 --> 04:00.000
Your Majesty, do you require his reply?

04:00.020 --> 04:01.100
No.

04:01.460 --> 04:02.600
Just show this to him.

04:02.620 --> 04:03.700
Yes, Your Majesty.

04:09.940 --> 04:11.660
Impeachment?

04:15.150 --> 04:16.180
[Fan's Residence]

04:16.180 --> 04:18.360
Inspector Fan Xian
of the Imperial Inspectorate

04:18.380 --> 04:20.560
took a bribe of 3,000 taels in public

04:20.580 --> 04:22.660
and disregarded the law blatantly.

04:22.900 --> 04:25.680
He actually accepted bribes
in broad daylight!

04:25.700 --> 04:27.220
He's too bold for his own good!

04:27.260 --> 04:31.460
He disregards the law of Qing State!
He's the scourge of our state!

04:31.940 --> 04:34.360
We will stand up to him!

04:34.380 --> 04:36.540
We will rid the state of a great evil!

04:37.940 --> 04:40.020
Too bold for his own good?

04:40.580 --> 04:42.580
Arrogant?

04:44.820 --> 04:46.540
I guess I'm a scoundrel.

04:55.180 --> 04:56.240
I'm done.

04:56.260 --> 04:56.940
Thank you, Eunuch Hou.

04:56.940 --> 04:57.920
Mr. Fan, what are you saying?

04:57.940 --> 05:00.000
This is my duty.

05:00.020 --> 05:02.420
I'll head back first, then.

05:02.700 --> 05:03.440
Someone.

05:03.460 --> 05:04.860
See Eunuch Hou off.

05:12.500 --> 05:13.780
Mr. Fan.

05:16.780 --> 05:19.440
Please forgive me for being nosy,

05:19.460 --> 05:23.300
but how do you plan to deal with this?

05:24.520 --> 05:25.880
Did His Majesty tell you to ask me that?

05:25.900 --> 05:26.800
No.

05:26.820 --> 05:28.120
I'm just curious.

05:28.140 --> 05:31.100
How do you think we should
deal with this in the usual manner?

05:31.500 --> 05:34.100
Since the officials and censors
are trying to impeach you,

05:34.580 --> 05:37.540
this is no longer a minor deal.

05:37.700 --> 05:38.500
No matter what,

05:38.500 --> 05:39.800
Mr. Fan,

05:39.820 --> 05:42.580
you have to submit a memorandum
to defend yourself.

05:42.620 --> 05:43.560
After that,

05:43.580 --> 05:46.580
we can wait for His Majesty's judgment.

05:47.820 --> 05:49.560
What if I don't give them any responses?

05:49.580 --> 05:51.240
That's going against the rules.

05:51.260 --> 05:53.040
The Imperial Procuratorate
is impeaching you.

05:53.060 --> 05:54.600
But now, you're not
giving them a response.

05:54.620 --> 05:58.340
That means you're looking down
upon the censors.

05:58.580 --> 06:01.880
So, I'm looking down on them
if I'm not giving any response?

06:01.900 --> 06:03.540
I don't think that's enough.

06:05.820 --> 06:08.100
Mr. Fan.

06:10.060 --> 06:11.760
I was too nosy.

06:11.780 --> 06:14.340
Please don't act recklessly.

06:17.580 --> 06:18.380
Have you heard?

06:18.380 --> 06:20.800
[Imperial Procuratorate]
Fan Xian didn't submit a self-defense statement

06:20.800 --> 06:22.680
even after facing impeachment.

06:22.700 --> 06:24.360
That's ridiculous!

06:24.380 --> 06:26.040
He's truly arrogant indeed.

06:26.060 --> 06:28.360
He disregarded the law of the Qing State

06:28.380 --> 06:30.600
and ignored our impeachment!

06:30.620 --> 06:32.560
He's too bold for his own good.

06:32.580 --> 06:33.780
Precisely.

06:35.460 --> 06:36.900
And...

06:38.260 --> 06:39.420
Who are you?

06:40.820 --> 06:43.540
Me? I'm Wang Qinian.

06:44.500 --> 06:48.420
Under Inspector Fan Xian's order,

06:49.140 --> 06:51.140
I'm here to deliver a painting

06:51.940 --> 06:53.700
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

06:55.700 --> 06:56.380
What painting?

06:56.380 --> 06:57.540
To whom?

06:58.700 --> 07:00.980
All those who have impeached Mr. Fan

07:01.140 --> 07:02.780
may take a look.

07:06.580 --> 07:07.660
Wait.

07:08.180 --> 07:10.460
You can take a look when I'm gone.

07:12.140 --> 07:13.460
Who's this?

07:13.500 --> 07:14.380
Fan Xian sent him here.

07:14.380 --> 07:15.320
Go ahead!

07:15.340 --> 07:15.920
Fan Xian?

07:15.940 --> 07:17.020
Hurry, open it.

07:17.020 --> 07:18.320
What painting is this?

07:19.940 --> 07:21.160
What painting is this?

07:21.180 --> 07:22.540
Hurry and open it.

07:23.580 --> 07:24.660
This...

07:25.060 --> 07:26.140
This is...

07:28.100 --> 07:30.340
The censors of the Imperial Procuratorate
are targeting Fan Xian?

07:30.340 --> 07:31.420
That's right.

07:31.940 --> 07:32.800
They're impeaching him

07:32.820 --> 07:34.260
for the 3,000 taels
he took from Eunuch Dai

07:34.260 --> 07:36.100
of the Crop Inspection Bureau.

07:37.940 --> 07:39.460
Who initiated it?

07:40.300 --> 07:42.100
I think they initiated it themselves.

07:42.900 --> 07:44.920
Fan Xian took the bribe in public.

07:44.940 --> 07:47.580
It's reasonable for
the Imperial Procuratorate to be informed.

07:53.500 --> 07:55.020
It's only 3,000 taels.

07:57.580 --> 07:59.460
It's not a huge deal.

08:01.940 --> 08:04.000
If Fan Xian submits
a self-defense statement,

08:04.020 --> 08:06.660
I don't think they'll press charges
against him until the end.

08:08.480 --> 08:10.380
Fan Xian didn't submit
any self-defense statement.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.380
Instead, he sent Wang Qinian
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

08:12.380 --> 08:15.220
He delivered a painting to the censors
who impeached him.

08:16.140 --> 08:17.460
What painting was it?

08:17.500 --> 08:19.600
[Imperial Procuratorate of Qing]
Wild dogs barking?

08:19.620 --> 08:21.340
Isn't he insulting us here?

08:21.620 --> 08:22.700
How dare he insult us like that?

08:22.700 --> 08:23.500
He's too bold!

08:23.500 --> 08:25.040
He has no respect for us at all!

08:25.060 --> 08:27.220
[Wild dogs barking]
Such audacity!

08:27.260 --> 08:28.560
He's too arrogant!

08:28.580 --> 08:29.980
What an arrogant scum!

08:30.260 --> 08:31.140
That's too arrogant of him!

08:31.140 --> 08:32.260
He's too arrogant!

08:32.260 --> 08:34.120
- Let's impeach him!
- Yes! Let's impeach him!

08:34.140 --> 08:34.880
We have to impeach him!

08:34.900 --> 08:35.880
- We have to!
- That's right!

08:35.900 --> 08:37.740
We have to impeach him!

08:39.020 --> 08:40.640
Wild dogs barking?

08:40.660 --> 08:42.820
He's trying to offend all of them.

08:43.620 --> 08:45.660
He's too young and reckless.

08:45.780 --> 08:48.740
I assume he has offended
the entire Imperial Procuratorate.

08:49.020 --> 08:51.300
I don't think this is over.

08:51.900 --> 08:52.980
Your Highness,

08:53.220 --> 08:56.020
why don't we join them
in impeaching him as well?

08:56.500 --> 08:58.180
Why should we join them?

08:58.820 --> 09:01.080
This is a good chance for us
to kick him while he's down.

09:01.100 --> 09:03.300
We still don't know
whether he's down or not.

09:04.100 --> 09:05.540
We'll stay out of this.

09:06.220 --> 09:07.900
We'll just enjoy the show.

09:12.420 --> 09:16.000
All of the censors
are impeaching him now?

09:16.020 --> 09:18.520
That's right. Initially,
there were only a few of them.

09:18.540 --> 09:21.600
Now, the entire Imperial Procuratorate
sees him as their common enemy.

09:21.620 --> 09:25.420
They're doing everything they can
to impeach Fan Xian and you, Sir.

09:25.500 --> 09:28.080
What has this got to do with me?

09:28.100 --> 09:30.900
You were the one who gave him
the 3,000 taels after all.

09:32.500 --> 09:35.000
3,000 taels is nothing in the Capital.

09:35.020 --> 09:36.720
It's not even worth mentioning.

09:36.740 --> 09:38.240
You even said that they were dogs.

09:38.260 --> 09:39.480
I didn't say that!

09:39.500 --> 09:41.120
To the Imperial Procuratorate,

09:41.140 --> 09:44.360
you and Fan Xian are in the same boat.

09:44.380 --> 09:46.300
I only met him once.

09:46.300 --> 09:48.540
How am I in the same boat as him?

09:48.540 --> 09:50.180
They said

09:50.380 --> 09:52.000
that you only met him once in public.

09:52.020 --> 09:53.240
But no one knew

09:53.260 --> 09:55.000
how many times you two met in secret.

09:55.020 --> 09:56.880
I heard that
the Imperial Procuratorate said

09:56.900 --> 09:59.640
that they suspected you of colluding
with Fan Xian long ago.

09:59.660 --> 10:01.760
They said you already acknowledged him
as your godfather.

10:01.780 --> 10:03.120
Nonsense!

10:03.140 --> 10:05.000
Do you know how old I am?
Do you know how old he is?

10:05.020 --> 10:07.240
Why should I acknowledge him
as my godfather?

10:07.260 --> 10:08.120
Sir,

10:08.140 --> 10:10.960
since it has come to this,
we shouldn't dwell on your age.

10:10.980 --> 10:13.020
I...

10:14.980 --> 10:15.600
I...

10:15.620 --> 10:17.060
Listen up!

10:20.660 --> 10:23.540
Fan Xian has truly lost his mind!

10:23.660 --> 10:25.950
Those stubborn fools
in the Imperial Procuratorate

10:25.951 --> 10:27.030
don't even fear death!

10:27.030 --> 10:28.780
They only fear that
their reputation will be damaged!

10:28.780 --> 10:29.760
But him?

10:29.780 --> 10:31.780
He said that they were dogs!

10:32.140 --> 10:34.620
He actually said that they were dogs!

10:52.140 --> 10:53.880
Eunuch Hong,

10:53.900 --> 10:56.420
what should I do now?

10:56.500 --> 10:57.580
Sir,

10:57.900 --> 10:59.620
since it has come to this,

11:00.140 --> 11:01.660
it's no longer related to you.

11:01.660 --> 11:04.520
How could you say
that it's not related to me?

11:04.540 --> 11:08.300
I'm the person
they're trying to impeach here!

11:13.300 --> 11:15.820
What kind of mess
have I got myself into?

11:37.300 --> 11:38.740
You left home pretty early.

11:39.780 --> 11:41.260
You're earlier than me.

11:41.500 --> 11:42.800
I was waiting for you.

11:42.820 --> 11:43.380
Have something.

11:43.380 --> 11:45.400
We shouldn't starve ourselves
in the morning.

11:50.360 --> 11:51.890
The incident with
the Crop Inspection Bureau

11:51.891 --> 11:53.280
is getting out of control.

11:53.540 --> 11:55.020
What exactly are you up to?

11:57.700 --> 12:00.460
The leads on Chengze's collusion
with Northern Qi have been cut off.

12:00.500 --> 12:01.780
But that's fine.

12:02.780 --> 12:04.260
Someone reminded me

12:04.740 --> 12:06.080
that I wasn't dealing with matters.

12:06.100 --> 12:07.700
I was dealing with an individual.

12:11.300 --> 12:13.140
Don't worry.
There are no outsiders here.

12:16.800 --> 12:19.000
What has this got to do
with the Crop Inspection Bureau?

12:19.020 --> 12:21.560
Chengze colluded with Northern Qi
for the sake of money.

12:21.580 --> 12:23.760
But the money will go to waste
if he doesn't spend them.

12:23.780 --> 12:27.540
Where do you think
he can spend his money on?

12:29.100 --> 12:30.520
To keep an army in secret.

12:30.540 --> 12:31.620
What else?

12:35.260 --> 12:38.420
To bribe officials
and cultivate his lineage.

12:40.060 --> 12:41.880
You're using the Crop Inspection Bureau
as an excuse.

12:41.900 --> 12:44.120
In reality, you're investigating
the corrupt officials.

12:44.140 --> 12:46.500
I can investigate the officials
within the Capital.

12:46.520 --> 12:49.140
However, Chengze's faction consists of
more than just officials from the Capital.

12:49.140 --> 12:50.980
When it comes to investigating
places other than the Capital,

12:50.980 --> 12:53.660
the First Division is inferior to the Fourth Division.

13:00.380 --> 13:01.460
All right.

13:02.800 --> 13:05.100
I'll investigate the officials
outside of the Capital.

13:07.420 --> 13:08.480
You agreed to help me already?

13:08.500 --> 13:09.600
I'm not doing it for you.

13:09.620 --> 13:10.520
I know.

13:10.540 --> 13:12.260
You're doing it for the Qing State.

13:14.500 --> 13:16.120
Do you have any capable assistants?

13:16.140 --> 13:17.080
Lend them to me.

13:17.100 --> 13:18.400
You're in charge of the Fourth Division.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.500
Why would you need to borrow manpower?

13:19.500 --> 13:21.000
My father is the division supervisor.

13:21.020 --> 13:22.260
It's not me.

13:24.020 --> 13:25.300
What's the difference?

13:26.220 --> 13:27.520
I don't want the Imperial Inspectorate

13:27.520 --> 13:29.640
to adopt the practice of
passing positions to their offspring.

13:29.640 --> 13:30.620
We're serving the state here.

13:30.620 --> 13:33.200
We have to differentiate
between public and private affairs.

13:39.500 --> 13:40.200
Mr. Fan.

13:40.220 --> 13:41.420
Young Master Yan.

13:41.780 --> 13:42.860
Wang?

13:43.260 --> 13:44.340
Gao?

13:45.020 --> 13:46.080
Help out Young Master Yan

13:46.100 --> 13:47.640
for the time being.

13:47.660 --> 13:48.740
Yes, Mr. Fan.

13:50.780 --> 13:52.300
Young Master Yan, order away.

13:52.500 --> 13:55.000
Gao Da, I remember that you belong
to the Tiger Guards.

13:55.020 --> 13:55.760
That's right.

13:55.780 --> 13:56.840
But from today onward,

13:56.860 --> 13:58.120
the Tiger Guards

13:58.140 --> 14:00.500
will serve Mr. Fan.

14:03.580 --> 14:05.240
The Tiger Guards
belong to the Imperial Guards.

14:05.260 --> 14:06.780
They only serve His Majesty.

14:07.660 --> 14:08.400
That's right.

14:08.420 --> 14:11.200
His Majesty sent Gao Da to me
just when I was in dire need of manpower.

14:11.220 --> 14:12.360
Sometimes, I don't know

14:12.380 --> 14:14.820
what His Majesty is thinking about.

14:15.420 --> 14:16.840
The emperor's will is hard to predict.

14:16.860 --> 14:18.180
I agree.

14:19.800 --> 14:21.180
Are you leaving already?

14:26.380 --> 14:27.660
Why aren't you leaving?

14:27.780 --> 14:29.600
You haven't paid for this yet.

14:29.620 --> 14:31.140
I have to pay for that?

14:31.900 --> 14:33.480
Mr. Yan, before you came,

14:33.500 --> 14:35.000
Mr. Fan said

14:35.020 --> 14:36.240
that you booked

14:36.260 --> 14:38.180
the entire bun stall.

14:38.220 --> 14:40.300
I don't understand
what booking means either.

14:40.780 --> 14:43.020
I think it's that the filling,

14:43.500 --> 14:44.480
the dough,

14:44.500 --> 14:45.840
the stove, and the beverages

14:45.860 --> 14:47.480
are all paid for.

14:47.500 --> 14:48.580
Gao.

14:48.620 --> 14:49.760
Tell our brothers

14:49.780 --> 14:51.900
to finish the rest of the buns.

14:51.980 --> 14:52.260
Okay.

14:52.260 --> 14:53.480
As for the filling,

14:53.500 --> 14:54.960
I'll take it back home.

14:54.980 --> 14:58.140
I'll make some meatballs
for Baba tonight.

15:02.900 --> 15:04.940
The filling smells great.

15:09.900 --> 15:11.540
This filling is excellent.

15:37.380 --> 15:39.580
Master, I heard that the memorandums

15:39.580 --> 15:41.700
that the Imperial Procuratorate
submitted to impeach Fan Xian

15:41.700 --> 15:43.020
have been increasing.

15:43.260 --> 15:44.540
That's true.

15:45.340 --> 15:46.240
It has already come to this.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.760
Aren't you anxious at all?

15:47.780 --> 15:49.300
I heard that the censors

15:49.300 --> 15:50.620
were reprimanding your mother every day.

15:50.620 --> 15:51.500
It's more than that.

15:51.500 --> 15:53.420
They even reprimanded our ancestors.

15:54.380 --> 15:56.420
Weren't the censors
educated individuals?

15:56.620 --> 15:58.140
Even so, they're still humans.

15:58.140 --> 16:00.000
They'll do something desperate
when cornered.

16:00.020 --> 16:01.620
That doesn't sound nice.

16:03.300 --> 16:04.900
What should we do now?

16:05.100 --> 16:07.020
Why don't we send them some gifts?

16:07.380 --> 16:08.500
It's pointless.

16:08.900 --> 16:11.840
The censors want to safeguard
their dignities the most.

16:11.860 --> 16:14.880
Let's forget about the painting
that Fan Xian sent to them for now.

16:14.900 --> 16:16.880
He's been impeached
countless times lately.

16:16.900 --> 16:19.360
But he never submitted a single
self-defense statement at all.

16:19.380 --> 16:21.400
He does what he usually does.

16:21.420 --> 16:23.900
He doesn't take them seriously at all.

16:24.220 --> 16:26.660
This is utter humiliation.

16:26.900 --> 16:29.140
How could they tolerate it?

16:30.220 --> 16:32.540
Are educated individuals that petty?

16:33.860 --> 16:35.140
Master, you're excluded.

16:35.380 --> 16:36.100
Look at you.

16:36.100 --> 16:38.420
Why did you have to
offend them for no reason?

16:38.900 --> 16:40.780
Why don't I head to the palace?

16:40.800 --> 16:42.380
I'll try to fish out information
from Her Majesty.

16:42.380 --> 16:45.100
You can find a chance to apologize
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

16:47.100 --> 16:48.300
Something's off.

16:48.620 --> 16:50.260
You're not Madam Liu.

16:50.620 --> 16:52.780
Madam Liu wouldn't
be concerned about me.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.620
Stop messing around.

16:54.980 --> 16:56.740
I'm truly surprised by your concern.

16:57.500 --> 16:59.420
How is Sizhe...

16:59.500 --> 17:01.140
Sizhe is fine.

18:09.700 --> 18:11.000
How's the situation?

18:11.020 --> 18:11.800
I've checked it.

18:11.820 --> 18:14.480
I haven't detected the mobilization
of Northern Qi's border army.

18:15.700 --> 18:18.780
Seems like these are
all the men we have.

18:19.220 --> 18:20.460
Prepare to strike.

18:20.500 --> 18:21.800
Leave no one alive

18:21.820 --> 18:23.440
except for Fan Sizhe.

18:23.460 --> 18:26.980
Remember, we're Northern Qi's
Embroidered Uniform Guards.

18:27.820 --> 18:29.780
We have nothing to do with
the Qing State.

19:05.020 --> 19:07.300
Weren't you organized
when you persuaded Sizhe

19:07.740 --> 19:09.680
to leave the Capital?

19:09.700 --> 19:11.100
Why are you being willful now?

19:11.100 --> 19:12.980
Look at all the impeachment memorandums
they submitted against you.

19:12.980 --> 19:14.680
You should at least submit
a self-defense statement.

19:14.680 --> 19:16.000
You can't just let it be.

19:16.020 --> 19:17.080
Enough.

19:17.100 --> 19:18.720
Fan Xian isn't Sizhe.

19:18.740 --> 19:20.380
He knows what to do.

19:20.500 --> 19:23.540
Why are you criticizing Sizhe over this?

19:27.260 --> 19:28.740
Madam Liu is right.

19:28.780 --> 19:30.560
I should respond

19:30.580 --> 19:32.540
to all the memorandums they submitted.

19:32.580 --> 19:33.860
What will you reply?

19:35.100 --> 19:36.460
You'll know it later.

19:40.220 --> 19:41.240
We have plenty of meat today.

19:41.260 --> 19:42.620
Yeah, it's delicious.

19:42.740 --> 19:43.820
It's tasty indeed.

19:44.500 --> 19:45.580
Eat up.

19:45.740 --> 19:46.820
Eat up.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.660
It's delicious.

19:49.780 --> 19:50.860
It's nice.

19:54.220 --> 19:54.800
It's delicious.

19:54.820 --> 19:55.900
Yeah.

19:57.660 --> 19:58.740
Mr. Fan!

19:59.500 --> 20:00.580
Mr. Fan,

20:00.660 --> 20:03.080
the meat wasn't gifted by someone else.

20:03.100 --> 20:05.320
The First Division bought it

20:05.340 --> 20:07.200
with our own money.

20:07.220 --> 20:08.680
Our conscience is clear.

20:08.700 --> 20:09.920
Do you want some?

20:09.940 --> 20:11.020
No, thanks.

20:11.420 --> 20:12.640
Everyone, eat up.

20:12.660 --> 20:14.100
Get back to work after this.

20:17.260 --> 20:18.660
What was that?

20:18.680 --> 20:20.700
Yeah. Who does he think he is?

20:51.460 --> 20:52.520
You don't need to kneel.

20:52.540 --> 20:53.860
Be more resolute.

20:57.180 --> 20:58.260
Yes, Mr. Fan.

20:58.300 --> 21:00.640
It's been a few days since I came.
How's the First Division doing?

21:00.660 --> 21:02.620
Mr. Fan, everything's normal

21:03.460 --> 21:04.760
all thanks to your contribution.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.400
Everything is organized.

21:06.420 --> 21:08.300
What did they say about me in private?

21:09.460 --> 21:10.560
Of course they...

21:10.580 --> 21:14.080
Of course they admired you, Mr. Fan.

21:14.100 --> 21:15.220
Really?

21:15.340 --> 21:16.240
Yes.

21:16.260 --> 21:17.380
Let me guess.

21:19.940 --> 21:22.000
On the first day I came here,

21:22.020 --> 21:23.480
I sounded so grandiose.

21:23.500 --> 21:26.540
In the end, I took 3,000 taels
from Eunuch Dai on the same day.

21:26.580 --> 21:28.980
I'm a hypocrite
who favors money more than dignity.

21:28.980 --> 21:30.580
That's what they say about me, right?

21:30.860 --> 21:32.540
That's not true.

21:36.860 --> 21:38.260
Is this all you're having?

21:39.260 --> 21:40.840
Mr. Fan, I'm ashamed.

21:40.860 --> 21:42.780
Isn't the First Division
having meat today?

21:45.300 --> 21:46.640
I'm just grabbing a bite.

21:46.660 --> 21:49.300
I have too many affairs to handle.

21:50.020 --> 21:52.180
I heard that the First Division

21:52.180 --> 21:53.960
bought the meat with their own money.

21:53.980 --> 21:54.720
Naturally.

21:54.740 --> 21:55.780
No one dared accept gifts

21:55.780 --> 21:58.040
after your lecture.

21:58.060 --> 22:00.100
If so, where did they
get the money from?

22:00.780 --> 22:03.620
Mr. Fan, isn't it just like what you said?
It's from our own accounts.

22:08.240 --> 22:10.080
I've already checked
the First Division's accounts.

22:10.100 --> 22:12.020
There have been
some transactions lately.

22:12.060 --> 22:13.580
There's an extra 50 taels.

22:14.500 --> 22:16.760
Therefore, they took out some of it

22:16.780 --> 22:17.760
to buy some meat.

22:17.780 --> 22:19.680
They did it to reward themselves.

22:19.700 --> 22:21.000
You know that, right?

22:21.020 --> 22:22.100
Yes, Mr. Fan.

22:22.980 --> 22:25.740
Where did the extra 50 taels come from?

22:26.860 --> 22:29.320
There are plenty of
miscellaneous affairs in the division.

22:29.340 --> 22:30.760
A mere 50 taels

22:30.780 --> 22:32.580
won't affect anything.

22:33.060 --> 22:35.180
The amount of money
that Wang Qinian gave you

22:35.460 --> 22:37.700
back in the Crop Inspection Bureau,

22:38.660 --> 22:39.940
how much was it?

22:43.580 --> 22:44.820
Mr. Fan,

22:45.020 --> 22:46.180
it was 50 taels.

22:47.260 --> 22:49.780
So you recorded it in the accounts?

22:52.060 --> 22:56.260
I owe the division money
in the first place.

22:56.420 --> 22:57.520
That's why I repaid my debt.

22:57.540 --> 22:58.560
You had a debt?

22:58.580 --> 22:59.980
Was there any proof of debt?

23:05.820 --> 23:08.180
I've spent the past few days
going through your profile.

23:08.780 --> 23:09.980
Deng Ziyue,

23:11.100 --> 23:14.100
the Crop Inspection Bureau delivered
Yunmeng fish to us for many years,

23:14.540 --> 23:16.780
yet you never took any of them.

23:19.500 --> 23:20.440
Mr. Fan,

23:20.460 --> 23:23.340
I don't like to eat fish.

23:24.780 --> 23:28.540
So you don't like fish or meat?

23:30.500 --> 23:32.200
The First Division cooked meat today.

23:32.220 --> 23:34.620
You could say that it was
bought with your money.

23:35.500 --> 23:37.340
But now, you're just having plain buns?

23:39.100 --> 23:40.260
What's the matter?

23:40.860 --> 23:42.540
Do you think the money is dirty?

23:42.820 --> 23:43.640
I dare not think so.

23:43.660 --> 23:45.040
Why not?

23:45.060 --> 23:46.800
This isn't your first time doing this.

23:46.820 --> 23:48.220
The Crop Inspection Bureau had delivered

23:48.220 --> 23:49.820
more than just fish and meat
to our division.

23:49.820 --> 23:51.460
They delivered all kinds of
expensive ingredients to us.

23:51.460 --> 23:53.000
And, everyone in the division
got a share.

23:53.020 --> 23:55.220
But you're the only person
who refused to take them.

23:55.420 --> 23:56.760
Besides that,

23:56.780 --> 23:59.260
all the expensive gifts that were
gifted to us from all the departments

23:59.260 --> 24:01.260
such as amber Mahjong sets
and white jade dice,

24:01.260 --> 24:03.220
you didn't accept any of them.

24:04.860 --> 24:07.460
Deng Ziyue, you do have integrity, huh?

24:08.860 --> 24:10.740
You're something else.

24:11.260 --> 24:13.020
But I don't understand something.

24:13.420 --> 24:15.340
Since you have such integrity,

24:15.500 --> 24:17.300
why didn't you report the others?

24:17.820 --> 24:19.300
I know my fault!

24:19.700 --> 24:21.240
Don't kneel yet.

24:21.260 --> 24:22.560
Do you think I'm trying to blame you?

24:22.580 --> 24:24.860
I'm asking you
why you didn't report the rest.

24:26.300 --> 24:28.100
Mr. Fan, this is the officialdom.

24:28.100 --> 24:30.020
You see,

24:30.540 --> 24:32.440
there's no need
to offend anyone on purpose.

24:32.460 --> 24:33.440
Don't you agree?

24:33.460 --> 24:34.540
Is that so?

24:35.700 --> 24:37.180
This is the current you.

24:37.460 --> 24:39.840
The past Deng Ziyue wasn't like this.

24:39.860 --> 24:42.520
The past Deng Ziyue
was passionate and fervent.

24:42.540 --> 24:45.280
If anyone in the division dared lie
in order to receive benefits,

24:45.300 --> 24:46.860
you reprimanded
every single one of them,

24:46.860 --> 24:49.380
including your direct superior.

24:49.740 --> 24:52.300
I'm ashamed.

24:52.500 --> 24:55.700
Back then, I was dumb.

24:56.860 --> 24:58.520
Since when did you stop
reprimanding them?

24:58.540 --> 25:00.220
Since when did you start kneeling?

25:05.100 --> 25:06.580
Mr. Fan, I...

25:08.700 --> 25:11.100
Back then, I didn't know
how the world worked.

25:12.020 --> 25:13.780
I was too arrogant.

25:13.820 --> 25:15.960
But now, I'm sensible.

25:15.980 --> 25:17.080
What have you learned?

25:17.100 --> 25:18.780
I learned

25:19.860 --> 25:22.500
that officials shouldn't
try to stand out.

25:22.500 --> 25:25.200
We have to be humble
and act like the rest.

25:25.220 --> 25:27.020
Act like the rest, huh?

25:27.020 --> 25:29.040
If so, you should take the fish, then.

25:29.060 --> 25:30.540
Act like the rest?

25:31.300 --> 25:33.260
Now, you can't afford
to wear proper clothing?

25:35.260 --> 25:36.540
Deng Ziyue,

25:37.060 --> 25:38.460
you came from a poor family in Dingzhou.

25:38.460 --> 25:40.460
You were once a stableman
of the border army.

25:41.020 --> 25:43.920
Back then, a commandant
falsified the accounts.

25:43.940 --> 25:46.640
Using horse feed as an excuse,
he embezzled government funds.

25:46.660 --> 25:47.860
It's you.

25:48.500 --> 25:50.980
You broke through the encirclement

25:50.980 --> 25:53.020
and delivered the evidence of his crime
to the Imperial Inspectorate.

25:53.020 --> 25:56.240
Mr. Chen granted you special admission
due to your integrity.

25:56.260 --> 25:57.940
Am I right?

26:01.540 --> 26:03.480
Mr. Fan, I never expected you
to check my background.

26:03.500 --> 26:04.540
You came from a poor family.

26:04.540 --> 26:06.000
You made a vow when you were young.

26:06.020 --> 26:08.540
Maintaining your integrity
was above all else, even wealth.

26:09.260 --> 26:10.480
Back then, in Dingzhou, you stormed to

26:10.500 --> 26:13.340
the entrance of the Imperial Inspectorate
covered in blood.

26:13.660 --> 26:16.440
The way you requested
justice to be upheld,

26:16.460 --> 26:18.820
do you still remember
what you looked like back then?

26:19.780 --> 26:21.000
Mr. Fan,

26:21.020 --> 26:24.020
I do.

26:28.740 --> 26:30.020
If so,

26:31.220 --> 26:33.540
do you think that
the past you was a fool?

26:39.780 --> 26:42.340
The world is unfair.

26:43.700 --> 26:47.300
With blood, I summoned a storm.

26:47.420 --> 26:50.300
Mr. Fan, I was plain stupid back then.

26:53.180 --> 26:55.260
You were plain stupid back then?

26:56.260 --> 26:57.340
Deng Ziyue,

26:59.100 --> 27:01.540
what caused you to end up like this?

27:03.780 --> 27:05.300
You're prone to bowing

27:06.180 --> 27:07.940
and kneeling to people now.

27:09.460 --> 27:12.580
I wonder if the past you would cry

27:13.780 --> 27:15.820
if he sees the current you?

27:16.460 --> 27:17.540
Mr. Fan,

27:17.780 --> 27:21.760
as officials,
we have to maintain our relationships.

27:21.780 --> 27:22.640
Am I right?

27:22.660 --> 27:23.780
I know.

27:24.180 --> 27:26.560
Once, you had a chance to be promoted
to the vice division supervisor.

27:26.580 --> 27:29.200
However, you were demoted for times
because you stood up for justice.

27:29.220 --> 27:31.320
In the end, you were demoted

27:31.340 --> 27:33.780
to an insignificant chief clerk.

27:34.860 --> 27:36.180
It's been so many years.

27:36.860 --> 27:38.500
That's why you've submitted to them.

27:38.700 --> 27:40.960
Yes, I've submitted to them long ago.

27:40.980 --> 27:43.000
If so, you should submit
to them entirely!

27:43.020 --> 27:44.220
Deng Ziyue,

27:44.820 --> 27:46.760
didn't you say you should
act like the rest?

27:47.060 --> 27:48.480
Look at the state you're in.

27:48.500 --> 27:51.200
Why did you record
the extra 50 taels you received?

27:51.220 --> 27:54.300
Why didn't you take the gifts
at your doorstep?

27:55.060 --> 27:56.380
Since that's the case,

27:56.700 --> 27:58.740
why are you still obeying the rules?

27:59.820 --> 28:01.860
Are you trying to retain your dignity?

28:02.020 --> 28:05.180
Or do you want others
to praise you for being dignified?

28:07.020 --> 28:08.780
Answer me!

28:14.660 --> 28:15.780
Mr. Fan.

28:16.540 --> 28:17.620
Mr. Fan.

28:24.540 --> 28:26.940
Look at me.

28:27.060 --> 28:29.180
I've ceased to be dignified long ago.

28:29.260 --> 28:30.780
I, Deng Ziyue,

28:32.020 --> 28:34.860
only hope to maintain
my personal integrity.

28:39.860 --> 28:42.820
That should be enough.

28:50.220 --> 28:51.940
If so, we're the same.

28:55.340 --> 28:56.580
To be honest,

28:56.820 --> 29:00.700
I'm only trying to maintain
my personal integrity as well.

29:02.500 --> 29:03.940
I don't feel like tolerating the things

29:03.940 --> 29:05.700
that I dislike.

29:05.820 --> 29:08.340
If someone offends me,
I'll seek revenge.

29:09.500 --> 29:12.540
Even so, I reached this rank
with this temper of mine.

29:13.020 --> 29:14.220
What gives?

29:17.460 --> 29:18.820
Mr. Fan, it's all because

29:19.020 --> 29:22.220
you're ambitious and extraordinary.

29:22.220 --> 29:23.980
It has nothing much to do with that.

29:24.780 --> 29:26.260
If so, Mr. Fan,

29:28.220 --> 29:29.700
it must be because of
your literary talent.

29:29.700 --> 29:31.180
That's even more far-fetched.

29:31.860 --> 29:32.940
Mr. Fan,

29:33.420 --> 29:35.680
I have no idea, then.

29:35.700 --> 29:37.700
It's because people were backing me up.

29:40.060 --> 29:41.340
With this temper of mine,

29:41.360 --> 29:43.220
I couldn't survive more than three days
in the Capital

29:43.220 --> 29:45.020
without the backing of my elders.

29:45.300 --> 29:46.460
Don't you agree?

29:48.200 --> 29:49.980
If you wish to be a good guy
and retain your bottom line,

29:49.980 --> 29:51.560
it's best to have a backer first.

29:51.580 --> 29:52.780
Deng Ziyue,

29:52.860 --> 29:54.180
do you have a backer?

29:55.180 --> 29:56.080
I don't.

29:56.100 --> 29:57.500
Now, you have one.

30:00.060 --> 30:01.460
From now on,

30:01.740 --> 30:03.300
I'm your backer.

30:04.100 --> 30:05.000
You can try

30:05.020 --> 30:07.300
to find back the past you.

30:07.340 --> 30:09.800
Try and shift your bottom line upward.

30:09.820 --> 30:11.260
Don't be afraid of trouble.

30:11.300 --> 30:12.620
I'll cover your back.

30:13.500 --> 30:14.160
Mr. Fan...

30:14.180 --> 30:16.240
I know you can't fully trust me yet.

30:16.260 --> 30:17.340
There's no rush.

30:17.700 --> 30:19.820
We don't judge a person
by what they say.

30:20.660 --> 30:22.180
We judge them by what they do.

30:24.020 --> 30:24.480
Let's go.

30:24.500 --> 30:25.780
Let's get to work first.

30:25.860 --> 30:28.000
Mr. Fan, what do we need to do?

30:28.020 --> 30:29.040
Write a memorandum for me.

30:29.060 --> 30:29.980
A self-defense statement.

30:29.980 --> 30:31.660
Deliver it to them
under the First Division's name.

30:31.660 --> 30:32.740
Mr. Fan.

30:33.000 --> 30:34.540
I don't think
it's appropriate for me to write it.

30:34.540 --> 30:36.020
My handwriting is terrible.

30:37.060 --> 30:38.260
Yes, Mr. Fan.

30:44.120 --> 30:46.400
There's no need to grind any ink.
Write it just like that.

30:46.740 --> 30:47.400
Mr. Fan,

30:47.420 --> 30:50.020
I can't write much without grinding ink.

30:50.060 --> 30:51.360
That's more than enough.

31:02.939 --> 31:05.388
[Fan Xian's Self-Defense Statement]

31:06.300 --> 31:08.100
Fan Xian's self-defense statement
is in the palace now?

31:08.100 --> 31:09.220
Yes, Your Highness.

31:09.340 --> 31:11.300
Looks like he couldn't
hold out any longer.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.380
Actually, it's too late.

31:13.660 --> 31:16.560
At this moment, the censors
are impassioned.

31:16.580 --> 31:18.300
Even if his self-defense statement
is flawless,

31:18.300 --> 31:19.920
he might not be able
to resolve this issue.

31:19.940 --> 31:21.500
There's no way it's flawless.

31:21.940 --> 31:23.860
There are only two sentences.

31:25.340 --> 31:26.620
What are they?

31:27.154 --> 31:29.722
[Fan Xian's Self-Defense Statement]

31:40.300 --> 31:42.780
Fan Xian's Self-Defense Statement, huh?

31:43.820 --> 31:46.020
Traitorous officials are in power.

31:47.500 --> 31:49.060
What crime have I committed?

31:52.940 --> 31:54.580
Traitorous officials are in power.

31:54.740 --> 31:56.460
What crime have I committed?

31:56.980 --> 31:58.800
Such a self-defense statement
is unprecedented

31:58.820 --> 32:01.000
in the history of Qing State
ever since its founding.

32:01.020 --> 32:02.280
It's more than just Qing State.

32:02.300 --> 32:04.680
This is the only one of its kind
in the history of mankind.

32:04.700 --> 32:07.340
Initially, thought the painting itself
was enough to offend all of them.

32:07.340 --> 32:08.320
I was wrong.

32:08.340 --> 32:09.820
This self-defense statement,

32:10.060 --> 32:12.100
it's the cream of the crop.

32:13.700 --> 32:15.200
But isn't it worse

32:15.220 --> 32:16.800
to refer to them as dogs?

32:16.820 --> 32:17.980
Your Highness.

32:18.980 --> 32:20.640
Although it's infuriating when people

32:20.660 --> 32:22.020
refer to you as a dog,

32:22.300 --> 32:24.020
it's nothing more than a normal insult.

32:24.200 --> 32:26.080
But the censors regard
their reputation highly.

32:26.100 --> 32:28.280
The sentence
"Traitorous officials are in power"

32:28.300 --> 32:31.020
is targeting the foundation
of the Imperial Procuratorate itself.

32:33.298 --> 32:37.128
[Imperial Procuratorate of Qing State]

32:42.060 --> 32:43.580
This is too much!

32:43.793 --> 32:44.950
[What crime have I committed?]

32:44.970 --> 32:46.958
[Traitorous officials are in power.]

32:47.260 --> 32:49.180
The handwriting is pretty good.

32:51.460 --> 32:52.960
Did he write this?

32:52.980 --> 32:55.780
I think the First Division
wrote it on his behalf.

32:57.020 --> 32:58.460
I was wondering.

33:00.220 --> 33:01.740
The Immortal Poet,

33:02.300 --> 33:03.820
you're such an embarrassment.

33:08.060 --> 33:09.580
The Imperial Procuratorate.

33:11.020 --> 33:12.540
Fan Xian.

33:14.185 --> 33:16.651
[Fan Xian took bribes.]
[Traitorous officials are in power.]

33:18.860 --> 33:20.700
Neither side is willing to give in.

33:21.180 --> 33:23.300
If so, they can confront
each other in the court.

33:27.760 --> 33:29.240
For the court session tomorrow,

33:29.260 --> 33:31.460
Fan Xian and the censors
will confront each other.

33:31.580 --> 33:33.180
The edict has already been issued.

33:34.220 --> 33:35.300
How exciting.

33:35.660 --> 33:37.840
I must watch the show
in person tomorrow.

33:37.860 --> 33:39.180
Speaking of which,

33:39.220 --> 33:41.960
Fan Xian has never entered the court
ever since he came to the Capital.

33:41.980 --> 33:43.480
Tomorrow will be his first time there.

33:43.500 --> 33:45.320
He's having a showdown there
on his first visit.

33:45.340 --> 33:47.000
I expect great things from him
in the future.

33:47.020 --> 33:49.540
Maybe the censors will corner him.

33:50.500 --> 33:51.580
It's hard to say.

33:53.260 --> 33:55.000
Anyway, we just need
to observe their battle

33:55.020 --> 33:56.260
and enjoy the show.

33:56.660 --> 33:58.060
Naturally.

34:05.340 --> 34:06.100
Bi'an.

34:06.120 --> 34:07.300
Yes, Your Highness.

34:07.700 --> 34:10.300
Prepare the scrolls
related to Baoyue Pleasure House.

34:10.380 --> 34:12.127
I'll bring them to the court tomorrow.

34:12.147 --> 34:14.107
Your Highness, are you trying to
deal Fan Xian a fatal blow

34:14.108 --> 34:15.980
on behalf of the Imperial Procuratorate?

34:17.620 --> 34:19.500
Better to be safe than sorry.

34:22.223 --> 34:25.285
[Fan's Residence]

34:27.980 --> 34:30.300
He's been sweeping the floor
for a while now.

34:32.780 --> 34:35.100
He's trying to calm himself down.

34:36.860 --> 34:40.160
It's Fan Xian's first visit
to the court tomorrow.

34:40.180 --> 34:42.200
If things do get out of hand,

34:42.220 --> 34:44.180
Master, you should see to it.

34:44.700 --> 34:46.240
I'm in charge
of the Ministry of Revenue.

34:46.260 --> 34:49.760
I cannot intervene in the conflict
between them.

34:49.780 --> 34:51.240
Your department doesn't matter.

34:51.260 --> 34:52.640
Both of you are from the same family.

34:52.660 --> 34:54.360
The Imperial Procuratorate
has plenty of members.

34:54.360 --> 34:55.300
Fan Xian is all by himself.

34:55.300 --> 34:56.720
How can they compete with each other?

34:56.740 --> 34:58.240
You don't understand.

34:58.260 --> 35:00.360
I shouldn't speak in the court tomorrow.

35:00.380 --> 35:03.300
If not, it'll be detrimental
to him instead.

35:03.780 --> 35:06.840
It all depends on him
whether Sizhe could return or not.

35:06.860 --> 35:08.940
He mustn't get himself in trouble.

35:09.340 --> 35:10.960
Don't worry.

35:10.980 --> 35:13.340
If his life is in danger,

35:13.580 --> 35:16.420
I'll protect him
even if I have to risk my life.

35:16.740 --> 35:19.180
You're truly nice to Fan Xian.

35:19.900 --> 35:22.140
I'll do the same for Sizhe.

35:22.340 --> 35:25.100
If so, you should
treat yourself better too.

35:43.700 --> 35:45.400
Would you remain on the rooftop

35:45.420 --> 35:47.140
if I didn't sense your presence?

35:48.360 --> 35:50.140
Why aren't you telling
your servants to sweep the floor?

35:50.140 --> 35:51.180
My limbs are intact.

35:51.180 --> 35:52.440
I don't want to trouble others.

35:52.460 --> 35:54.020
Mr. Chen has a message for you.

35:54.040 --> 35:55.760
The result you wanted
Yan Bingyun to acquire

35:55.780 --> 35:57.280
has been handed to him.

35:57.300 --> 36:00.100
Mr. Fan, please don't worry
when you head to the court tomorrow.

36:00.140 --> 36:01.620
Thank Yan for me.

36:01.700 --> 36:02.820
Mr. Fan,

36:02.900 --> 36:06.940
has Mr. Wuzhu returned to the Capital?

36:08.380 --> 36:10.040
Did Mr. Chen tell you
to ask me that too?

36:10.060 --> 36:11.620
I'm asking you of my own accord.

36:14.260 --> 36:15.460
I don't know.

36:58.790 --> 37:00.840
[Forced Prostitution
at Baoyue Pleasure House]

37:00.860 --> 37:02.220
Your Highness.

37:05.260 --> 37:06.580
Your Highness.

37:10.900 --> 37:12.300
Your Highness.

37:13.980 --> 37:15.800
Your Highness,
why are you standing here?

37:15.820 --> 37:17.060
I was waiting for you.

37:18.100 --> 37:19.720
Are you here to laugh at me?

37:19.740 --> 37:21.200
You didn't need to resort to this.

37:21.220 --> 37:22.300
I don't get it.

37:22.380 --> 37:23.280
Do you know why

37:23.300 --> 37:25.340
no one is willing to
go against the censors?

37:26.700 --> 37:28.760
When you compete against
these literati and scholars,

37:28.780 --> 37:29.760
you get nothing when you win.

37:29.780 --> 37:31.780
But when you lose,
you'll be beyond redemption.

37:31.860 --> 37:34.100
Why did you put yourself
on the same level as them?

37:34.300 --> 37:35.300
Maybe we would become friends

37:35.300 --> 37:37.180
in the court later.

37:37.380 --> 37:39.340
If so, I'd chop off my head
and let you use it as a ball.

37:39.340 --> 37:41.520
Your Highness,
you don't need to be this courteous.

37:41.940 --> 37:43.840
Anyway, you should
practice caution later.

37:43.860 --> 37:45.420
If it doesn't work out,
you should take a step back.

37:45.420 --> 37:46.700
I'll make a plea for you.

37:47.660 --> 37:48.680
No need for that.

37:48.700 --> 37:49.780
However,

37:49.980 --> 37:51.700
I do have a favor to ask of you.

37:52.180 --> 37:53.340
Tell me about it.

37:53.660 --> 37:55.040
Your Highness, you know this too.

37:55.060 --> 37:57.220
Today's my first time
attending a court session.

37:57.940 --> 38:01.360
I know nothing about the rites and rules

38:01.380 --> 38:02.240
I have to observe.

38:02.260 --> 38:03.602
I need someone to teach me.

38:03.622 --> 38:04.702
Mr. Xin.

38:04.900 --> 38:05.700
I was looking for you.

38:05.700 --> 38:06.780
Is that so?

38:08.660 --> 38:09.760
Mr. Xin,

38:09.780 --> 38:11.680
I have to tell you this again...

38:11.700 --> 38:12.780
Xin Qiwu!

38:15.940 --> 38:17.020
Come here!

38:22.580 --> 38:23.720
Your Highness.

38:23.740 --> 38:24.820
Mr. Fan.

38:25.180 --> 38:27.320
I don't know what's wrong with me.

38:27.340 --> 38:29.620
How could I fail
to see you two just now?

38:30.060 --> 38:31.460
Join Fan Xian in the court.

38:33.300 --> 38:36.100
Teach him about the rites and rules.

38:37.140 --> 38:38.200
My pleasure.

38:38.220 --> 38:39.420
My pleasure.

38:40.140 --> 38:41.220
Well,

38:41.340 --> 38:42.500
good luck.

38:48.620 --> 38:50.060
Mr. Xin!

38:52.940 --> 38:53.800
Mr. Fan.

38:53.820 --> 38:55.420
Why didn't you ask me out for a drink?

38:57.180 --> 38:58.900
I was busy with official affairs.

38:59.580 --> 39:01.220
Mr. Xin, it must've been tough on you.

39:01.780 --> 39:03.580
If it's too tiring,

39:03.620 --> 39:06.700
you could apply for sick leave.

39:07.660 --> 39:08.780
You have a point.

39:09.340 --> 39:10.880
It's just that it's too late.

39:10.900 --> 39:12.380
His Highness already left.

39:14.260 --> 39:15.360
Why are they

39:15.380 --> 39:17.300
staring at us?

39:19.780 --> 39:20.640
Those are

39:20.660 --> 39:22.980
the Imperial Procuratorate's censors.

39:24.220 --> 39:25.780
I see.

39:27.620 --> 39:30.380
If so, why do they keep staring at you?

39:30.860 --> 39:32.540
Do they have a feud against you?

39:33.100 --> 39:34.900
Look, there are some over there too.

39:40.860 --> 39:41.980
Mr. Fan.

39:42.660 --> 39:44.220
I'll be honest with you.

39:44.300 --> 39:48.080
Now, if anyone stands beside you,

39:48.100 --> 39:50.820
they'll see them as their enemies.

39:51.100 --> 39:53.500
They'll become their sworn enemies.

39:55.900 --> 39:57.180
Mr. Xin, don't worry.

39:57.340 --> 39:58.680
You just need to enjoy the show

39:58.700 --> 40:00.160
when we're in the court later.

40:00.180 --> 40:02.120
Do not speak up for me.

40:02.140 --> 40:04.780
Remember. You must restrain yourself.

40:05.620 --> 40:06.780
I'll try my best.

40:07.260 --> 40:08.340
Well,

40:08.540 --> 40:09.620
Mr. Fan,

40:09.660 --> 40:11.260
pardon me for being nosy,

40:11.415 --> 40:13.700
but the censors
in the Imperial Procuratorate

40:13.860 --> 40:15.860
have been infuriated for some days...

40:15.860 --> 40:17.240
Do you wish to magnify their anger?

40:17.260 --> 40:18.340
What?

40:18.540 --> 40:20.060
Nothing. You may continue.

40:20.660 --> 40:23.160
They will never let you off easily.

40:23.180 --> 40:24.920
Therefore, you have to deal with them

40:24.940 --> 40:26.680
cautiously.

40:26.700 --> 40:27.980
What a coincidence.

40:28.780 --> 40:29.860
What is it?

40:30.780 --> 40:32.940
I don't plan to let them off either.

40:39.860 --> 40:41.500
Mr. Xin, say,

40:42.860 --> 40:44.620
how many of them do you think

40:44.900 --> 40:47.260
are here to enjoy the show?

40:53.420 --> 40:54.980
I'm afraid it's all of them.

40:55.460 --> 40:57.420
What if the audience

40:57.420 --> 40:59.620
become the actors themselves?

41:03.220 --> 41:05.260
Let's go. Time to go inside.

41:06.300 --> 41:07.380
Mr. Fan,

41:07.940 --> 41:09.860
what exactly are you up to?

41:38.180 --> 41:39.060
Good morning.

41:39.080 --> 41:40.160
Good morning.

41:40.180 --> 41:41.260
Good morning.

41:41.940 --> 41:43.020
Good morning.

41:43.140 --> 41:44.700
Good morning.

41:44.900 --> 41:46.020
Good morning.

41:46.700 --> 41:48.700
Good morning, my fellow peers.

41:48.820 --> 41:49.940
Good morning.

41:50.980 --> 41:52.060
Mr. Fan.

41:53.100 --> 41:54.440
His Majesty hasn't arrived yet.

41:54.460 --> 41:56.340
Look. Do you see that?

41:56.380 --> 41:57.920
Do you see this area?

41:57.940 --> 41:59.760
This is where the civil officials stand.

41:59.780 --> 42:01.040
Later, you will

42:01.060 --> 42:02.360
stand over there.

42:02.380 --> 42:03.460
Over there.

42:03.740 --> 42:04.860
As for me,

42:05.060 --> 42:06.300
I'll stand over there.

42:06.900 --> 42:08.500
I'll head there first, then.

42:09.520 --> 42:10.920
His Majesty hasn't arrived yet, right?

42:10.940 --> 42:11.680
Let's have a chat.

42:11.700 --> 42:12.680
You want to chat?

42:12.700 --> 42:13.260
About what?

42:13.260 --> 42:14.720
What did you have for breakfast?

42:14.740 --> 42:16.960
The meat buns in the Western market
are pretty nice.

42:18.340 --> 42:19.140
I don't think

42:19.140 --> 42:20.380
this is the largest hall, right?

42:20.380 --> 42:22.780
We need to wait
for His Majesty's decision.

42:23.140 --> 42:24.500
That's right.

42:25.420 --> 42:28.080
His Majesty thinks that
the main hall is too big.

42:28.080 --> 42:29.580
We don't have enough members
to fill the hall.

42:29.580 --> 42:30.640
And, we can't hear him clearly.

42:30.660 --> 42:31.740
Therefore, we're using this hall

42:31.740 --> 42:33.460
for morning court sessions.

42:33.860 --> 42:34.960
I see.

42:34.980 --> 42:36.940
Well, I'll head there now.

42:48.220 --> 42:49.420
What is this?

42:50.460 --> 42:52.100
His Majesty granted him a seat.

42:54.060 --> 42:56.700
Even the Crown Prince is standing,
you know? Who is he?

42:56.780 --> 42:59.620
The Commissioner-in-Chief,
General Qin Ye.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.262 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
